OL,3,ATurnout so far highest on record as
OL,4,AIsraelis vote in pivotal election
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe campaign has been shaped by the
OL,7,Fissues of democracy and security, and
OL,8,Fthe election is widely being seen as a
OL,9,Freferendum on Netanyahu's rule.
